---
import {makeLessons} from '../../public/chem/simple-lessons.js';
const lessons=makeLessons(),lesson=lessons[0],first=lesson.steps[0];
---
<section id="start" class="simple-study">

  <h1>CHEM 004 study notes</h1>
  <p class="simple-intro">Learning Check 2 · Thursday, October 22</p>
  <nav class="lesson-path" aria-label="Lesson path"><button id="lesson-back" type="button" disabled>← Previous lesson</button><span id="lesson-count">Lesson 1 of 10</span><button id="lesson-forward" type="button">Next lesson →</button></nav>
  <div class="simple-lesson" aria-labelledby="simple-title">
    <h2 id="simple-title">{lesson.title.replace(/^\d+\. /,'')}</h2>
    <div class="simple-scenario"><p><span>Given</span><strong id="simple-given">{lesson.given}</strong></p><p><span>Find</span><strong id="simple-wanted">{lesson.wanted}</strong></p></div>
    <p id="simple-progress" class="simple-progress" role="status">Step 1 of {lesson.steps.length}</p>
    <div id="simple-step">
      <h3 id="simple-step-title" tabindex="-1">{first.title}</h3>
      <p id="simple-why">{first.why}</p>
      <figure id="simple-sketch" hidden></figure>
      <p id="simple-notation" class="notation-key" hidden></p>
      <pre id="simple-work" aria-label="Worked step">{first.work}</pre>
    </div>
    <div id="simple-quiz" hidden>
      <fieldset><legend id="simple-question" tabindex="-1"></legend><div id="simple-options"></div></fieldset>
      <button type="button" id="simple-check">Check my answer</button>
      <p id="simple-feedback" role="status" hidden></p>
      <button type="button" id="simple-next-topic">Next topic →</button>
    </div>
    <div class="simple-actions"><button type="button" id="simple-prev" disabled>← Back</button><button type="button" id="simple-next" class="primary">Next step →</button></div>
    <details id="simple-terms-detail"><summary>What do these words mean?</summary><p id="simple-terms">{lesson.terms}</p></details>
    <div id="simple-lecture-content" aria-label="Lecture note"></div>
    <div class="simple-secondary"><button type="button" id="simple-restart">Restart this example</button><button type="button" id="simple-new-example">New example values</button><a id="simple-reference" href="#particles">Full explanation</a></div>
  </div>
  <details class="simple-scope"><summary>What does this cover?</summary><p>Based on supplied Lectures 1–7, notes 1–4 and Activities 3–6. Your exam is Thursday, October 22. October 20’s lecture and Activities 7–8 were not supplied. This is an independent study guide; the instructor’s official scope takes priority.</p><p>Purple means an exact transcript quote. Gold means a paraphrase of lecture emphasis or a worked method. Each lecture note links to its source.</p></details>
  <noscript><p>Step buttons need JavaScript. Open the full reference below for the complete worked examples.</p></noscript>
</section>
